WEBVTT

00:03.020 --> 00:07.270
The intertwined fates of men give the Mononoke its Form.

00:07.570 --> 00:11.070
Enter the woman, protecting her child.

00:11.070 --> 00:15.530
Enter the mistress who gives the woman shelter for the night.

00:15.530 --> 00:19.330
Enter the man who seeks the woman.

00:19.330 --> 00:21.580
They all reside beneath the same roof.

00:21.580 --> 00:26.540
A splendid cast, set against the nightly
bustle, the splash of drink and the clatter of cups,

00:26.540 --> 00:30.050
and the innocent sound of children’s voices.

00:30.050 --> 00:36.590
Though the voices were clear, the children were
absent, except for the one in the woman’s womb.

00:36.590 --> 00:39.890
The Mononoke is most certainly a Zashikiwarashi,

00:40.640 --> 00:43.640
but where are the Truth and Regret?

01:13.460 --> 01:17.800
The blue moon illuminated

01:17.840 --> 01:21.760
your wandering shadow.

01:22.390 --> 01:26.270
I could never tell you all I wanted to say.

01:26.270 --> 01:31.190
It was so very frustrating.

01:31.270 --> 01:35.070
I think about your faked smile,

01:35.650 --> 01:39.700
and forget all the hot tears we shed.

01:40.160 --> 01:42.370
What do these empty husks,

01:42.410 --> 01:48.210
those empty eyes of yours, reflect, my dear?

01:48.960 --> 01:53.420
The transient quarter moon

01:53.800 --> 01:55.590
hides in a rift in the clouds,

01:55.550 --> 01:57.970
as darkness seeps up from the ground.

01:58.010 --> 02:02.430
Tell me the truth, please.

02:02.760 --> 02:04.600
Are you so despondent

02:04.680 --> 02:08.980
that you still sit alone, sighing?

02:09.480 --> 02:10.940
Part the Second

02:17.990 --> 02:22.700
There is something within this lodge.

02:31.080 --> 02:34.880
The pregnant girl and this inn…

02:33.790 --> 02:34.880
I’m sorry.

02:35.550 --> 02:38.840
I’ll protect you.

02:36.420 --> 02:38.840
Does this perhaps bring

02:39.630 --> 02:41.510
I’m sorry!

02:41.180 --> 02:42.390
anything to mind?

02:41.510 --> 02:43.600
There, there.

02:48.100 --> 02:50.600
What of the man the Mononoke killed?

02:51.020 --> 02:52.400
Do you know him?

03:04.030 --> 03:07.830
The man’s name was Naosuke.

03:08.410 --> 03:09.410
He was an assassin.

03:10.660 --> 03:11.710
Why was he here?

03:13.250 --> 03:16.960
To kill me and my unborn child.

03:15.710 --> 03:16.960
Sh—She was serious about that?

03:16.960 --> 03:19.220
Sh—She was serious about that?

03:19.220 --> 03:20.170
Who sent him?

03:21.880 --> 03:23.760
My master and mistress.

03:23.760 --> 03:24.800
Why?

03:26.430 --> 03:29.890
Because its father is their heir.

03:29.890 --> 03:31.020
It was an unallowable—

03:31.020 --> 03:32.310
Relationship.

03:35.150 --> 03:38.650
But they did allow it!

03:38.650 --> 03:39.900
Good lord.

03:39.900 --> 03:42.570
They just suddenly said it couldn’t be, that it was forbidden!

03:40.990 --> 03:41.950
Idiot.

03:41.950 --> 03:42.570
Stupid girl.

03:42.570 --> 03:44.410
Stupid girl.

03:44.410 --> 03:46.120
I didn’t want their property!

03:45.240 --> 03:47.160
So naive.

03:46.120 --> 03:48.330
I promised the young master!

03:48.330 --> 03:51.750
I just wanted to give birth!

03:51.750 --> 03:52.540
That’s all!

03:59.880 --> 04:02.720
God, you’re so annoying!

04:02.720 --> 04:05.680
I don’t care if it’s a Mononoke or a ghost, or what, I…

04:10.770 --> 04:13.690
If there’s something in this house,

04:13.690 --> 04:16.440
then why don’t we just leave?

04:23.280 --> 04:24.490
How the…

04:24.490 --> 04:25.660
What…

04:25.660 --> 04:27.120
Huh?

04:31.870 --> 04:32.870
My goodness.

04:38.380 --> 04:41.210
What on Earth is going on?

05:20.960 --> 05:22.340
Mother.

05:52.330 --> 05:53.870
It stinks.

06:19.560 --> 06:20.690
People?

06:38.080 --> 06:39.210
I’m sorry!

07:04.150 --> 07:04.940
What is

07:05.940 --> 07:07.320
this?

07:21.620 --> 07:26.750
Just where is this?

07:37.220 --> 07:40.980
This will be difficult.

07:41.020 --> 07:43.600
How can you be so relaxed?

07:43.600 --> 07:47.110
Do something about this!

08:00.500 --> 08:01.660
It’s gone?

08:06.590 --> 08:07.840
This way.

08:08.960 --> 08:09.920
It’s coming.

08:43.290 --> 08:45.670
It’s gone again.

09:03.770 --> 09:09.230
You’re the one who refuses to talk, ma’am.

09:09.230 --> 09:10.230
Now…

09:23.040 --> 09:28.960
This room was made as an offering to the dead.

09:41.510 --> 09:43.850
What do you mean, an offering?

09:46.770 --> 09:50.110
It was all I could do for them.

09:50.110 --> 09:52.900
All you could do?

09:52.900 --> 09:56.610
This house was once a brothel.

10:02.330 --> 10:05.040
Where is this, ma’am?

10:07.040 --> 10:09.460
This is the abortion room.

10:10.500 --> 10:13.210
It’s a grave for all the children produced.

10:15.920 --> 10:17.840
We were doing them a favor.

10:21.180 --> 10:22.680
What’s wrong with that?

10:22.680 --> 10:23.220
What?

10:28.560 --> 10:29.350
Huh?

10:40.660 --> 10:43.870
Shino?

10:44.740 --> 10:47.790
Shino, I love you.

10:52.000 --> 10:53.500
The young master,

10:53.960 --> 10:55.250
and myself?

10:58.220 --> 11:00.680
Shino, I love you.

11:01.430 --> 11:03.180
I love you.

11:04.100 --> 11:07.560
I am your servant.

11:07.560 --> 11:09.100
I love you.

11:10.440 --> 11:14.190
The master and mistress will not allow it.

11:14.190 --> 11:15.820
I love you.

11:15.820 --> 11:16.900
Let us marry!

11:19.650 --> 11:21.530
Marry?

11:21.530 --> 11:22.280
Are you sure?

11:22.280 --> 11:24.990
I don’t care what happens.

11:24.990 --> 11:26.200
Really?

11:26.580 --> 11:29.580
Really. You’re all I need.

11:33.290 --> 11:34.500
Oh, really?

11:36.500 --> 11:38.460
Then I can tell you.

11:38.460 --> 11:39.760
What is it?

11:39.760 --> 11:41.590
What can you tell me?

11:41.590 --> 11:43.890
I…

11:43.890 --> 11:47.430
I am carrying your child.

11:47.810 --> 11:49.180
Huh?

11:50.270 --> 11:51.440
Is that so?

11:55.360 --> 11:59.150
You’ll sleep with anyone who has money, right?

12:07.490 --> 12:09.790
What a stupid girl.

12:09.790 --> 12:12.250
Right, Tokuji?

12:14.210 --> 12:14.790
Yup.

12:34.730 --> 12:36.190
Mother.

12:38.610 --> 12:40.150
Mother.

12:42.950 --> 12:43.780
Mother.

12:46.870 --> 12:49.330
How nice!

12:51.330 --> 12:53.040
I’ve decided.

12:53.040 --> 12:54.960
I’ll use these people.

12:59.710 --> 13:01.880
Congratulations!

13:05.930 --> 13:07.760
Thank you.

13:12.520 --> 13:15.940
I’ve finally got a mother.

13:28.450 --> 13:30.120
Goodness, what a nuisance!

13:30.120 --> 13:33.580
She seems so nice.

13:34.540 --> 13:37.960
If you can’t work, you’ll never pay off your debt.

13:37.960 --> 13:40.880
It’s no good hiding.

13:43.630 --> 13:47.470
You’re useless.

13:48.800 --> 13:53.060
If you can’t work, you don’t eat.
You’re whores, sold to pay a debt!

13:56.730 --> 14:01.520
You can’t do your job with a child in the works.

14:02.400 --> 14:03.690
Stop it.

14:04.570 --> 14:06.360
In order to survive…

14:07.200 --> 14:08.280
Stop it!

14:08.280 --> 14:10.740
I had no choice.

14:46.150 --> 14:48.780
You’re with child, are you?

14:48.780 --> 14:49.860
That’s

14:49.990 --> 14:51.570
no good.

14:52.780 --> 14:56.080
We’ll help you out.

14:56.950 --> 14:58.330
If it’s gone…

15:00.210 --> 15:02.920
The Zashikiwarashi won’t come after you!

15:03.590 --> 15:04.750
Stop it!

15:04.750 --> 15:07.550
The Zashikiwarashi wanted to be born!

15:07.550 --> 15:09.550
That’s why they came after you.

15:09.550 --> 15:11.220
Stop it!

15:14.850 --> 15:17.600
Don’t kill him!

15:28.110 --> 15:29.240
No.

15:55.600 --> 15:56.930
Medicine Seller?

15:55.600 --> 15:56.930
Those tied to this room were killed when this was a brothel.

15:56.930 --> 16:01.560
Those tied to this room were killed when this was a brothel.

16:01.560 --> 16:04.150
A child’s emotions.

16:05.400 --> 16:08.900
Now for the Regret. Just one more.

16:08.900 --> 16:11.700
If I find the Regret, the sword can be drawn.

16:13.450 --> 16:15.240
What is it you want?

16:15.240 --> 16:16.370
Stop it!

16:16.370 --> 16:17.830
Don’t kill them!

16:17.830 --> 16:19.540
What did those poor children do to you?

16:20.750 --> 16:25.250
This is a Mononoke. It wishes to burst forth from your belly.

16:25.250 --> 16:27.750
It just wants to live in this world!

16:27.750 --> 16:31.090
But it cannot.

16:34.010 --> 16:35.050
Come here.

16:37.350 --> 16:40.060
I’ll give birth to you, as well.

16:49.610 --> 16:52.400
You wish to give birth to the Mononoke?

16:54.450 --> 16:58.740
All those within my womb are my children.

17:05.710 --> 17:07.460
Stop it.

17:07.460 --> 17:09.290
You’ll be sucked in.

17:12.130 --> 17:15.630
I will give birth to my child.

17:21.930 --> 17:22.930
That’s all I want.

17:27.400 --> 17:28.560
Why?

17:41.120 --> 17:43.040
Congratulations!

17:44.000 --> 17:47.210
I like this one!

17:48.750 --> 17:51.710
She always strokes me.

17:51.710 --> 17:53.050
So kind.

17:54.510 --> 17:55.720
So kind.

17:56.550 --> 17:57.760
So kind.

17:58.800 --> 18:00.050
So kind.

18:01.510 --> 18:02.390
So kind.

18:03.930 --> 18:05.100
So kind.

18:06.100 --> 18:07.310
So kind.

18:08.190 --> 18:09.310
So kind.

18:25.080 --> 18:26.790
I’m glad it was her.

18:28.460 --> 18:32.500
I’m sorry I had to hurt you so.

18:33.340 --> 18:38.220
Thank you for always trying your best.

18:39.800 --> 18:46.430
Thank you for talking to me so much.

18:47.020 --> 18:51.020
I love you.

18:54.020 --> 18:56.780
I love you.

18:59.700 --> 19:02.530
I love

19:02.530 --> 19:03.950
you.

19:11.500 --> 19:14.420
You’re welcome.

19:14.420 --> 19:24.010
Thank you for choosing me, for coming to me.

19:30.560 --> 19:36.610
I’m sorry. I could not be your mother.

19:36.610 --> 19:38.190
We can’t be together.

19:50.080 --> 19:51.370
I…

20:26.700 --> 20:34.210
Without you, I just can’t smile.

20:35.330 --> 20:45.260
I walk this banal town,

20:45.260 --> 20:51.350
feeling such intense emotions.

20:51.890 --> 20:57.730
I know that if I could treasure them and live on,

20:57.810 --> 21:07.030
I would need nothing else.

21:07.700 --> 21:15.210
The summer flowers that bloomed in the sky

21:15.210 --> 21:21.500
Come falling down, dancing in the wind.

21:21.590 --> 21:24.840
I can barely recall the night sky

21:24.840 --> 21:28.140
where they all came tumbling down,

21:28.140 --> 21:38.980
so what I can still recall is all the more precious.

21:46.740 --> 21:49.820
There, there. There, there.

22:01.540 --> 22:04.800
Well, I never did eat, did I?

22:10.720 --> 22:13.560
Are you sure I should be your mother?

22:17.350 --> 22:20.980
I hope to see you soon.

22:22.610 --> 22:29.990
The End
